@startuml F1.11-D02-submeter-formativa
title F1.11-D02 — Submeter formativa manualmente
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "FormativeController" as Ctrl
participant "SubmitFormativeUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: tipo + horas + PDF / Enviar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /formativas\n(multipart)
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)

note right of UC
  Valida elegibilidade do tipo
  origem=COMPROVANTE
end note

UC -> Postgres: INSERT formative_entry\nAGUARDANDO_CAAF\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: entrada
Ctrl --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Aluno: lista atualizada

@enduml
